      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey, my knee is in so much pain from the osteoarthritis that i can barely get out of bed. im on eliquis for my afib and i know i should be careful, but i really need to get some inflammation down so i can walk. can you just tell me what a safe dose of ibuprofen would be to take with my eliquis? i need a specific schedule or something so i know i'm doing it right.",
